 "remarks": "Welcome to 2435 Bedford Street, Unit 21-C, a beautifully updated ranch-style condo offering comfortable one-level living in a convenient Stamford location. Inside, the bright and inviting layout features 2 bedrooms and 2 full bathrooms, with thoughtfully updated finishes throughout. The kitchen is equipped with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances and flows easily into the surrounding living space, creating a comfortable setup for both everyday living and entertaining. The spacious primary bedroom offers its own private retreat with a full ensuite bathroom and walk-in closet, while the second bedroom provides flexibility for guests, a home office, or additional living space. In-unit laundry adds everyday convenience, making this home an easy place to simply settle in and enjoy. Parking is another standout, with a 1-car garage plus unassigned parking outside providing plenty of room for vehicles. When warmer weather arrives, the community's in-ground pool offers a great place to relax without the upkeep of having one of your own. The location brings even more to love. Ridgeway Shopping Center is just around the corner for everyday shopping, dining, and errands, while nearby Scalzi Park offers trails, sports courts, and plenty of outdoor recreation. Downtown Stamford is also within easy reach, where you can enjoy restaurants and entertainment along BedfordStreet, Mill River Park, and Stamford Palace Theatre.",
